      "content": "-22b by restriction enzyme cloning to establish an independent construct for preliminary expression and functional testing.\n\n**Figure 9 | NrSr–PelB–LSp222 response plasmid and expression circuit.**",
      "tags": "S4 B2 B4 B11 B1 X01 X03 X04 X08 EcN receiver NrSr FdeR PfdeAR negative fluorescence dose response 接收端 负荧光 基底泄漏 S5 S6 B2 B4 B14 B15 B16 B1 LSp222 antibacterial lysin turbidity OD600 61% 25% 64% 裂解酶 抗菌 纯化 选择性 S5 S6 B2 B4 B14 B1 X10 hEGF PelB two bands doublet 11.10 8.89 kDa supernatant 两个条带 双条带 信号肽 上清 促愈合"
